<title>USA: International Specialty Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>International Specialty Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					 Fourth Quarter   Twelve Months</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $172.3  $158.7  $716.5  $689.0</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of products sold	   98.6    92.4   418.9   414.7</p>
<p>Selling, general</p>
<p>     and administrative	    40.1    35.1   148.4   134.0</p>
<p>   Goodwill amortization	    3.3     3.3    13.2    13.2</p>
<p> Total costs and expenses	 142.0   130.8   580.5   561.9</p>
<p> Operating income		    30.3    27.9   136.0   127.1</p>
<p> Interest expense		   (6.8)   (8.3)  (28.7)  (33.1)</p>
<p>Equity in earnings of</p>
<p>   joint venture			0.7     2.5     5.6     5.4</p>
<p> Other income, net		    3.6     2.8    13.1     6.7</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	27.8    24.9   126.0   106.1</p>
<p> Income taxes			 (9.7)   (8.7)  (45.3)  (38.7)</p>
<p> Net income			    18.1    16.2    80.7    67.4</p>
<p> Earnings per common share	 0.19    0.17    0.83    0.68</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common shares</p>
<p>   outstanding (thousands)     96,463  97,822  97,197  98,613</p>
<p> EBITDA(A)			     48.0    45.7   206.2   188.4</p>
<p>(A)  EBITDA represents earnings before income taxes, increased by interest expense, depreciation, and goodwill amortization.</p>
<p>Full name of company is International Specialty Products Inc.</p>
